# Keep dev-only packages out of the release archive: tests/ and examples/
# load dev-only modules (rules_itest, rules_kind, rules_shell, @npm), which a
# consumer can't see. GitHub's tag tarballs honour export-ignore. (A
# git_override clone still has them.) dev/ is the dev-only npm workspace
# (package.json, pnpm-lock.yaml, //dev:node_modules), which loads @npm.
tests/ export-ignore
examples/ export-ignore
dev/ export-ignore
